.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt SCAN_XLONGN 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm scan_xlongn
.Nd parse an unsigned hexadecimal long integer from a bounded string
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In scan.h
.Ft size_t
.Fn scan_xlongn "const char *src" "size_t n" "unsigned long *dest"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn scan_xlongn
function parses an unsigned hexadecimal long integer from the buffer
.Fa src
of at most
.Fa n
bytes, storing the resulting value in
.Fa dest .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the number of bytes consumed.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr scan_longn 3